{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12002","headline":"巴西驿亭观江涨呈窦使君二首 一 · 杜甫","name":"巴西驿亭观江涨呈窦使君二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"转惊波作怒，即恐岸随流。\n赖有杯中物，还同海上鸥。\n关心小剡县，傍眼见扬州。\n爲接情人饮，朝来减半愁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12002.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12002","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}